<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-TASMANIA SCORE 235 FOR SIX V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-TASMANIA SCORE 235 FOR SIX V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>LAUNCESTON, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tasmania scored 235 for six in their limited overs match against Pakistan at the Tasmanian Cricket Association Ground on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score - Tasmania 235 for six in 50 overs (Shaun Young 59 not out) v Pakistan.</p>
